<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure | Hustle & Rise" description="How Hustle & Rise identifies and handles affiliate links and commercial recommendations.">
  <section class="legal-page px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><article class="prose prose-lg mx-auto max-w-4xl prose-headings:font-brand prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-[#172033] prose-p:text-[#566071] prose-p:leading-8 prose-li:text-[#566071]"><p class="section-eyebrow">Trust & transparency</p><h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1><p><strong>Last updated: 16 August 2026</strong></p><h2>Current position</h2><p>Hustle & Rise does not currently rely on undisclosed affiliate links. If affiliate partnerships are introduced, qualifying links and the relevant page or section will be clearly labelled.</p><h2>How affiliate links work</h2><p>An affiliate link may allow Hustle & Rise to receive a commission if a visitor makes a qualifying purchase. This should not increase the visitor’s price unless the external provider clearly states otherwise.</p><h2>Editorial independence</h2><p>Payment or commission does not guarantee a positive recommendation. Products and tools should be included because they are relevant to the reader and must not be presented with fabricated results, urgency, or earnings claims.</p><h2>Your choice</h2><p>You are never required to use an affiliate link. Compare alternatives, read the provider’s current terms, and make decisions based on your own needs.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Ask about a commercial relationship through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
